---
import MainLayout from "@/layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Trust Safety & Insurance"
  description="Trust, Safety & Insurance at NYCUNO"
  currentPage="Trust, Safety & Insurance"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <h1
      class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
      data-reveal="up"
    >
      Trust, Safety & Insurance
    </h1>

    <div class="text-base font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
      <p data-reveal="up">
        Ensuring the utmost trust, safety, and security for our users is a
        fundamental cornerstone of the nycuno platform. We recognize the
        importance of creating a secure environment that fosters confidence in
        every interaction. To achieve this, nycuno employs a stringent vetting
        process for all our partners, encompassing thorough background checks
        and verification procedures. This meticulous screening ensures that
        users can rely on the professionalism and credibility of those within
        the nycuno network.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5" data-reveal="up">
        Our commitment to user safety extends beyond the initial vetting
        process. nycuno integrates advanced real-time tracking features into
        the application, allowing users to monitor the status of their
        engagements in real-time. This transparency not only enhances the
        overall user experience but also ensures accountability throughout the
        service lifecycle. Additionally, nycuno prioritizes secure payment
        options within the app, promoting financial safety and peace of mind
        for our users.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5" data-reveal="up">
        Recognizing the unpredictability of life, nycuno takes proactive steps
        to provide comprehensive insurance coverage for users. This additional
        layer of protection is designed to address unforeseen circumstances
        and emergencies, offering users reassurance in their engagements on
        the platform. In the rare event that issues arise, nycuno's dedicated
        support team is readily available to assist users. Open communication
        channels and a responsive support system underscore our commitment to
        addressing user concerns promptly and effectively.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5" data-reveal="up">
        NYCUNO values the input of its user community and actively encourages
        feedback. We believe that fostering an open dialogue contributes to an
        ongoing culture of improvement and refinement. By consistently
        upholding the principles of trust, safety, and insurance, nycuno aims
        to be a reliable and secure platform that not only meets but exceeds
        the expectations of its diverse user base, enriching their overall
        experience with us.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>